  "notes": "One transaction with three operations: create_account of GALPCCZN\u2026 with 20 XLM, a native payment of 999999999599999700 stroops to it, and set_options master_weight 0 on the root. The source GAAZI4TC\u2026 is the raw ed25519 key 01947262\u20269c21 of the envelope. Both backfilled transfer events carry to_muxed_id \"hello world\" (the memo text, never an address) and the backfilled fee event charges 300. The lake object was written by stellar-core 23.0.1 long after the ledger closed (source.regenerated true), so its TransactionMeta is v4 with backfilled classic and fee events, not what a node emitted at the time. replay.indexer_scope is sdk-only: indexers are not expected to ingest Protocol 1 ledgers."
